e newly added"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"feature, has a unique ID (or a unique promote ID if in use). Failure to provide unique IDs will result"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"map-loading-error"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The method allows the user to provide a data ID, which will be returned as the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dataId"},{"text":" parameter in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"source-data-loaded","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" event. However, it’s important to note that multiple partial updates can be queued"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the same GeoJSON source when ongoing source parsing is taking place. In these cases, the partial"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"updates will be applied to the source in batches. Only the data ID provided in the most recent call within"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"each batch will be included in the "},{"code":"source-data-loaded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" event. If no data ID is provided in the most recent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"call, the data ID in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source-data-loaded"},{"type":"text","text":"event will be null."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside"},{"style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/StyleError"},{"type":"text","text":" if there is a problem removing features from the source."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps","doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/StyleManager"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://c